    {
      "id": "sec_ss8ssxmhcx",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "layout": {
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            8,
            4
          ],
          "m": [
            12
          ]
        },
        "mode": "stack"
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light",
        "background": {
          "color": "#e9e6d2",
          "type": "color"
        }
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_7kb7z881bn",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When someone is ready to go further than a meal and a conversation, our peers become their case managers. This is the long game: sustained, individualized support, advocacy, coordination and follow-through toward goals the person has set for themselves."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There’s no waiting list and no program to fit into. We ask what this person needs to move forward, and then we help make it happen."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Case management can look like:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Housing assessments and Coordinated Entry",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ", done on site, starting from where you are."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "IDs and vital documents",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ", including paying the small fees that stand in the way."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Benefits enrollment and advocacy",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ", like SNAP and Medicaid, Aid to the Needy Disabled, SSI and SSDI."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Health and behavioral health care",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": ", with warm handoffs: we introduce you to the provider, help you through intake, get you to the appointment, and follow up afterward."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Employment, education and legal resources.",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Problem-solving when something falls through.",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "bold"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " If something doesn’t work, we troubleshoot, try something else, and learn from it."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We don’t duplicate the larger system of care. We extend its reach, working with existing providers and care teams so people can get services they might otherwise never reach."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "What outcomes look like"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Housing matters, and we also know there is more than one way home. In a typical year, about 20 people who’ve worked with us reach stable housing. For about 5 of them, our part is limited to basic needs. We count the connection, but we don’t claim the housing as ours. Another 10 are people we support as part of a larger care team. For about 5, we’re the primary support helping them get there."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Of the housing outcomes where we’re the primary support, about four out of five are self-resolutions: individualized paths home that the person identified and pursued themselves."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "How to start"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Come to either weekly event and ask for a peer, or call or email us. Friday Breakfast Club is followed by drop-in hours for case management, troubleshooting, or just talking as peers."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
